# Complete source assistance on the development windows

Question: can both analysts receive complete source assistance for the same already exposed
observation population, with no silent filtering or promotion to physical truth?

Result: the two existing windows contain 16 distinct source keyframes, 960 annotation rows
and 4,876 prediction rows. The corrected preparation preserves all of them. Two fresh private
folders are byte-identical, including their completion receipts: seven files and 8,428,111 bytes
each. Preparation remains `prepared_not_disclosed`. No human judgment, reference constraint or
detector verdict was produced.

The [interface](../research/perception-assistance/0.1.0/README.md),
[reader](../research/perception-assistance/0.1.0/READER.md) and
[machine evidence](../research/perception-assistance/0.1.0/checkpoint.json) bind the implementation,
captured checks, exact output identities and costs. Raw data and source mappings remain private.

## Population and interpretation

Every source metadata keyframe inside each bound closed observation interval is included.
Context frames do not become additional comparison opportunities: the comparison still has its
two original anchors. The source sample table must agree with the bound catalog on exact
membership, scene and timestamp. Every selected annotation joins to its source instance,
category, attributes and visibility. Classes outside the detector taxonomy, low point counts,
distant objects, low scores and suppressed predictions remain visible in the later assistance.

Each entire prediction file is scanned again to establish key membership and exact array spans.
An absent results key, an explicit empty array and another sample's empty array have different
meanings. Parent hashes alone cannot distinguish these cases. The established normalizer also
reruns at both comparison anchors; complete receipts and base/addition/weight values reproduce.

Source geometry and invalid numeric values remain explicit. A structurally valid nominal
transform does not prove calibration accuracy. Keyframe boxes are not moved to asynchronous
captures by implication. Source track endpoints and valid immediate neighbors outside the
packet remain distinct. Global coordinates are deliberately disclosed only in this later
private assistance; identifier masking does not guarantee source anonymity or reviewer blindness.

## Checks and retained corrections

All 309 repository tests and 93 measurement tests pass, including 14 new assistance tests.
A separately structured private reader imports no Reiyah code and reconstructs source selection
and every projected annotation/prediction field. It reads all 34,149 metadata sample rows and
all 1,166,187 annotation rows, then confirms the selected 16 frames, 960 annotations and
3,077/1,799 prediction rows. It shares Python JSON, Decimal, archive and hashing libraries,
the expected source identities and upstream observation custody. This is engineering checking,
not independent external scientific review.

Review exposed a newly consumed global transform that could carry a string, an erased temporal
link that could masquerade as a source endpoint, and an endpoint list that raised an undeclared
type error. The corrected regressions reproduce three failures and two errors against the
earlier producer, then pass with typed transform projection and endpoint checks. The original
preparation is retained as superseded. A test-harness type mistake, a wrong unittest discovery
invocation and a streaming-archive interface mistake in the separate accounting script are also
retained and corrected. No expected rejection or numerical requirement was weakened.

The corrected preparations took 87.70 and 86.30 seconds, with measured process peaks of
494,731,264 and 462,995,456 bytes. The separate accounting check took 18.49 seconds. Some
verification overlapped on the same Mac. These are observed preparation costs, not benchmark
timings, person effort or a speedup claim. The conventional comparator is complete direct source
selection with equal information; no algorithmic or product advantage is inferred.

## What remains

The common inspection packet is not yet the complete analysis input. Before either method
calculates a comparison, both must receive identical neutral row-to-retained-detection mappings,
configuration roles, normalization rules, loss, weights, joint alternatives and clarifications.
Keep independent discoveries locked before assistance, and each method's conclusion locked
before cross-method comparison. Actual assignment, competence, independence, staged delivery,
practical viewing, review effort and adjudication require people and retained records.

The real open-reference unit-loss enclosure remains **[-8,8]**. The 60-scene physical study
remains unselected and unrun, with no seed. Gate A remains unaccepted. Offline Engine work and
professional main integration retain explicit operator authorization; the Console and parallel
research lanes retain their own ownership.
